SUMMARY:Artist Talk with Mirabel Wigon & Closing Reception 
DESCRIPTION:Pence Adult Art Programs\nMirabel Wigon will lead a walkthroug
 h and informal talk regarding the work in her exhibit *Earth Stars* at the
  Pence. She will discuss her practice\, the evolution of her work culminat
 ing in this project\, image/model making\, and environmental ideas of enta
 ngled collaboration that inform the paintings. Enjoy her Artist Talk\, vie
 w her exhibit\, and sample refreshments on its last day.\n\nArtist Talk wi
 th Mirabel Wigon & Closing Reception\nSunday\, August 16\, 3-4:30 PM (Free
 )\n\n*Earth Stars* is on display at the Pence Gallery from July 10 - Augus
 t 16\, 2026.
